Third-party material

1. Darwin Goedel Machine (https://github.com/jennyzzt/dgm), Copyright 2025 Jenny Zhang and Shengran Hu, Apache License
   2.0. The following files are derived from it and were modified for this study:
   - the coding agents: harness/seed_dgm/, harness/seed_dgm_cap16k/, harness/seed_strong/, harness/grid/*/,
     harness/redesign/*/, harness/ablate/*/, exps/*/agents/*/code/, flagship/agents/dgm_init/,
     flagship/agents/dgm_best/ (with flagship/agents/dgm_best_lineage.diff), flagship/agents/moves/ and
     flagship/agents/moves_retry/;
   - the self-improvement loop and its prompts, ported to LiveCodeBench: exp/dgm_lcb.py, exp/dgm_lcb_rmclean.py and
     exp/dgm_prompts.py;
   - the SWE-bench harness: flagship/swe/dgm_harness_proxy.py and flagship/swe/dgm_harness_proxy_clean.py
     (flagship/swe/harness_proxy.diff holds the changes against the DGM's swe_bench/harness.py, and
     flagship/swe/harness_proxy_clean.diff the further changes of the clean variant).
   The changes made by the self-improvement loops are recorded as diffs in exps/*/agents/*/patch.diff, and
   harness/ablate/*/manifest.json lists the patches applied in each ablation variant.

2. ADAS, Automated Design of Agentic Systems (https://github.com/ShengranHu/ADAS, commit 2702bee8), Copyright 2025
   Shengran Hu, Apache License 2.0. adas_p4/adas_port.py imports ADAS's modules from a checkout of that repository
   (not included) and replaces only the model call; the agents evaluated in adas_p4/full/*.code.py come from ADAS's
   released archives. The files in ext/adas/ are ADAS's released archives, unmodified.

3. exp/dgm_lcb_hgm.py implements the parent selection rule of the Huxley-Goedel Machine
   (https://github.com/metauto-ai/HGM) inside the loop of exp/dgm_lcb.py; it contains no code from that repository.

The SWE-bench patches in flagship/runs_full/*/predictions/*/all_preds.jsonl and
flagship/runs_r3/*/predictions/*/all_preds.jsonl modify the open-source repositories of the SWE-bench tasks and quote
parts of them, and flagship/swe/raw_github_cache.json holds requirement files from those repositories. Those parts
keep their original licenses.
